    "body": "The contents of the PR and the title don't seem to match. The title says that it disables the notification display, but the PR itself disables the entire `cmd_duration` module, including the display of the elapsed time.\r\n\r\nI think the current code is too coarse of a solution for #4148---we don't need to disable the display of the elapsed time in the prompt, just the notification.\r\n\r\nI also think the `tty_disabled` option, while nice, is overkill for this change. I expect the number of people who want to display freedesktop notification while working without a graphical environment whatsoever is going to be very low, and I don't want to have a rarely-exercised option hanging around unless it has demonstrable use. Let's go ahead and pull that out for now (unless someone has a concrete example of when it would be useful for them) and we can patch it in later if it's needed.",
    "state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED",
